# Araña, Heart of the Spider: an Equipment modifies a creature too (CR 700.9). Bot1 casts Araña, a Memnite and a Fugitive Wizard on
# turn 1. On turn 3 it casts a Basilisk Collar and equips it to the Memnite, then attacks with all three; Araña's attack trigger puts
# the counter on herself. Araña (counter) and the equipped Memnite are modified and each exiles a card as it deals combat damage to
# Bot2; the Fugitive Wizard, with nothing on it, does not: two cards are exiled and the third from the top of the library stays.

